menu "provider_ble"

    config PROVIDER_BLE_SEND_WAIT_MS
        int "Send wait (ms)"
        default 100
        range 1 5000
        help
          How long a send without CMD_SEND_NOWAIT (an answer) waits for room in its characteristic's buffer, then
          ERR_PROV_BUSY. A NOWAIT send (a PUSH frame) is ERR_PROV_BUSY at once.

    config PROVIDER_BLE_TX_ITEMS
        int "TX buffer (frames)"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
          How many frames of CMD_FRAME_MAX the TX buffer of a characteristic the provider makes holds
          (SYS_BLE_TX_BYTES).

endmenu
